{"version":1,"content":"<p>烏克蘭一家位於基輔的科技初創企業CODE380推出了一款小型無線電接收設備D·Vision SDR，能夠直接接收多種俄羅斯無人機通過無線電傳輸的實時視頻畫面。烏克蘭前線部隊藉助這款設備，可以在敵方無人機飛抵目標區域之前，提前看到無人機正在觀察什麼、飛向哪裏，以及操作員正在瞄準什麼目標。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1584842.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T08:02:11.514811+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":148,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T07:53:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T07:58:38.660762+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T07:58:38.660762+00:00","content_hash":"738c98da2050d821ec42d17f0044ac541bf1d07b507851470fe37ef2a76199e3","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}